        <section id="results" class="reading-section">
          <h2>Main results</h2>

          <p>
            On GLUE, the paper's headline result is that PPO turns LLAMA2-7B-chat-hf from a weak prompted NLU model
            into a model that beats strong encoder-only baselines on average. The important comparison is not only
            PPO vs prompting, but PPO vs SFT.
          </p>

