            where shallow label matching should not be enough: reading, coreference, commonsense, word-sense, and
            multi-sentence reasoning.
          </p>

          <p>
            The paper also compares <button class="anno" data-anno="ppo">PPO</button> with
            <button class="anno" data-anno="grpo">GRPO</button>. GRPO slightly improves the average score in the small
            comparison table, but it is slower because it samples multiple responses per prompt. PPO remains attractive
            because it gives a large gain over SFT with only a modest per-step runtime increase in the authors' setup.
